msgctxt "200"
msgid "Phew... urgh... uh? What the hell am I doing here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"Ow, ow, ow... I'm all sobered up again. Think I'll find a little place to "
"get my drink on before the last train."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"Me, I better call the wife. You know, you oughta settle down with someone! "
"Getting tied down isn't so bad, y'know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"I hate to say this after all your help... but did you have to damage my "
"taxi like that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "My insurance should cover it, but they've been a little particular lately..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Anyway, here. And thank you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "You got <Color:8>5,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "You got 2,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "Thanks so much! You've saved my business⑬for the night, at least."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "All right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "Here's something for your trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "You got <Color:8>20,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "You got 2,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "No man can tie me down, you got that? Not nobody, not nohow!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "Please, stop! You have to get down from there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "No man can tie me down, you got that? Not nobody, not nohow!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "Look, if you don't fasten your seatbelt, the police are going to blame me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid ""
"Oh, you wanna tie me down, huh? Izzat it? Well, too bad! You can't! See, "
"I'm even takin' off my tie!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "Hear, hear! You said it, pal! You got my vote!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "Wahahahah! Now this is a taxi ride!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid "Hey..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "What's going on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "Oh, these people wouldn't settle down and put their seatbelts on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid "Isn't that a law now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "Yep. Even backseat passengers need to wear seatbelts these days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid ""
"Seatbelts are just the tip of the iceberg! Nothing can tie me down! "
"Nothiiing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid ""
"Give it up already. You're in the way, and some people actually have places "
"to be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid "My company can eat shit and die! Everybody's tryin' to tie me down, man!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid "Hey, y'know the only one who can tie you down? I'll tell ya who... Taeko!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"Wahahaha! That's this guy's wife, see. Keeps her purse strings tighter than "
"a... well, uh, somethin' tight! Haw!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid "Taeko! I love youuu!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid "I need a taxi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid "I understand that, sir, but as you can see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "Taeko! I love youuu!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid ""
"I'll never make any money like this! Can't you do something about them? "
"Please!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid "Hey... You keep this up, and you'll have to deal with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid "The hell'd you say!? What, we got another guy tryin' to tie me down!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid "Screw that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid "I'd rather be the tie-er than the tie-ee!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "956"
msgid "I'll have to pass. Drunks aren't worth the hassle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "968"
msgid "Ugh, you're telling me... Tonight's gonna be a total bust."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1028"
msgid "What's going on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1040"
msgid "Give it up already."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1052"
msgid "I need a taxi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1064"
msgid "All right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1076"
msgid "Leave him be."
msgstr ""

